Approach

The application was designed as a lightweight proof-of-concept to demonstrate how AI-assisted workflows can improve efficiency in TTB alcohol label compliance reviews.

The system focuses on simulating how automation can reduce repetitive manual verification tasks performed by compliance agents, particularly during high-volume submission periods.

Key Objectives
Create a simple, accessible interface suitable for users with varying technical experience
Simulate automated compliance verification workflows for alcohol label review
Enable fast, browser-based processing with minimal setup requirements
Demonstrate how repetitive regulatory checks can be streamlined through automation
Support batch-style processing to reflect real-world high-volume workloads

The prototype was built using a web-based approach to ensure accessibility and easy deployment, aligning with modern workflow expectations for scalable government tools.

