Assumptions

The following assumptions were made during development:

The application is a proof-of-concept, not a production-ready system
Direct integration with the COLA system is outside the scope of this prototype
Users manually enter application data for verification comparison
Compliance agents remain responsible for final approval decisions
Uploaded label images are processed for review but not stored permanently
Security, authentication, and FedRAMP compliance requirements are not implemented
The system prioritizes usability, speed, and clarity over advanced AI/ML functionality due to prototype constraints
